{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37612","headline":"旅寓洛南村舍 · 郑谷","name":"旅寓洛南村舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"村落清明近，秋千稚女夸。\n春阴妨柳絮，月黑见棃花。\n白鸟窥鱼网，青帘认酒家。\n幽栖虽自适，交友在京华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}